890310664,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA2NjQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:input","name":"topic:input","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-09-06T20:55:47Z","updated_at":"2026-09-07T19:28:44Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in Godot 4.7.2\n\n### System information\n\nOnly web export was tested. Tested both in firefox on android and using the touch simulation from firefox desktop's responsive design mode\n\n### Issue description\n\nIn the web export of a project where \"Emulate mouse from touch\" is disabled when clicking an OptionButton to select an option, the game does not respond to any other touch events anymore.\nOther types of input events (when available on the system) do still work, and after another input event the touch works again (probably because the focus changes).\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- create a project with \"Emulate mouse from touch\" disabled\n- create a scene with an OptionButton with multiple options\n- export to web\n- open exported page on a device with a touchscreen (or an emulated touch pointer, like in firefox' responsive design mode)\n- click on the OptionButton\n- the page now does not respond to any touches anymore\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nSee https://github.com/jmdejong/godot-optionbutton-touch-block\n\nFor an already running web build, see https://troido.nl/godot-optionbutton-touch-block/","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123261/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123261/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}